[[0,1125581,0,7,3,4,"2016-06-22T04:52:00","E-werd","",[],"","PCGamer: We're running a Quake server all weekcome play with us!","http://www.pcgamer.com/were-running-a-quake-server-all-weekcome-play-with-us/?utm_content=buffer336cd&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=buffer-pcgamer","gaming"],[1,5585724,0,1,0,1,"2016-06-22T04:54:00","E-werd","",[],"<p>I was up way too late tonight playing, there was like 12 people on at one point. It was just like the old days, I had such a nostalgia boner.</p>\n<p>I suggest getting the shareware, buying the game on steam, or some other source of the game. Get <a href=\"http://fte.triptohell.info/ftedownloads/experimental\">FTEQWCL (FTE QuakeWorld Client)</a> and select &quot;Classic&quot; rendering for the oldschool look.</p>"]]
